
tree integer
  take self-type, like like

  hook fuse
    task add
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task subtract
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task multiply
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task divide
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task remainder
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task negate
      take a, like self-type
      like self-type

    task abs
      take a, like self-type
      like self-type

    task pow
      take a, like self-type
      take exp, like i32
      like self-type

    task min
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task max
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task compare-to
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like i32

    task equals
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like bool

    task bitwise-and
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task bitwise-or
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task bitwise-xor
      take a, like self-type
      take b, like self-type
      like self-type

    task bitwise-invert
      take a, like self-type
      like self-type

    task shift-left
      take a, like self-type
      take bits, like i32
      like self-type

    task shift-right
      take a, like self-type
      take bits, like i32
      like self-type

    task shift-right-unsigned
      take a, like self-type
      take bits, like i32
      like self-type

    task to-byte
      take a, like self-type
      like i8

    task to-short
      take a, like self-type
      like i16

    task to-int
      take a, like self-type
      like i32

    task to-long
      take a, like self-type
      like i64

    task to-float
      take a, like self-type
      like f32

    task to-double
      take a, like self-type
      like f64

    task to-string
      take a, like self-type
      like text

    task clone

form i8
  fuse integer
    bind self-type, like i8

form i16
  fuse integer
    bind self-type, like i16

form i32
  fuse integer
    bind self-type, like i32

form i64
  fuse integer
    bind self-type, like i64
